  <div>
    <span class="kicker">Follow the journey</span>
    <h2>Useful technology updates, without the noise.</h2>
    <p>Follow Surya Tech Codex on LinkedIn for new Tech Intelligence briefings, articles, videos, and practical engineering insights.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="subscribe-actions">
    <a class="button primary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/suryarock/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow on LinkedIn <span>↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
